@startuml UC9_View_Daily_Forecast_Activity_Diagram

title UC9: View Daily Forecast - Activity Diagram

start
:User selects "Daily Forecast" option;
:System retrieves daily forecast data for next 3 days;

if (Complete data available?) then (yes)
  :System displays forecast for each day
  showing three time slots (08:00, 15:00, 21:00);
  :System shows which service(s) provided the data;
else (partial)
  :System displays available data with gaps indicated;
endif

if (User wants to rate?) then (yes)
  :User rates individual forecasts (UC10);
endif

stop

@enduml
